      <h2>The 4-Step Actionable Walkthrough</h2>
      <div class="guide-step-flow">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 1: The $450 Juicer & Early Ground Cash Grab</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Player Need:</strong> How to skip manual grinding and secure your absolute first chunk of pocket cash.</li>
            <li><strong>The Blueprint Action:</strong> When you spawn at your tiny Level 1 Lemon Stand, don't waste time looking around. Click the stand to generate $1 bills, but keep your eyes glued to the floor! Ground cash spawns passively and walking over it accounts for 20% to 40% of your pre-automation income. Hoard every dollar until you hit exactly $450 to buy the Juicer upgrade.</li>
            <li><strong>The ROI Meta:</strong> The Juicer instantly doubles your stand's payout. This is mathematically verified as the single highest return on investment in the entire early-game meta.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 2: The $2,100 Milestone — Breaking Finger Fatigue</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Player Need:</strong> How to escape manual clicking entirely so you can actively explore the map.</li>
            <li><strong>The Blueprint Action:</strong> Now that your Juicer is running, push hard to accumulate your first milestone: $2,100. Do not spend cash on aesthetic base fences or signs yet. The second you hit $2,100, smash the button for the Cash Register Automator.</li>
            <li><strong>The ROI Meta:</strong> This automator completely eliminates the manual clicking requirement. It permanently frees up your action economy, allowing your base to print cash automatically while you roam around tracking down map secrets.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 3: Squeezing Your First $10K via the LemonDash Haggling Meta</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Player Need:</strong> Trigger massive, explosive burst payouts to rocket past the slow early-game grind.</li>
            <li><strong>The Blueprint Action:</strong> Save up $17,000 to purchase the LemonDash Delivery Garage. This unlocks the delivery logistics minigame, which completely dwarfs the Lemon Stand's income speed. NPCs will start pinging your phone with delivery orders.</li>
            <li><strong>The ROI Meta:</strong> NEVER auto-accept a phone offer! NPCs will try to lowball you. Always use the counter-offer option to haggle. Countering by 25% to 35% above their initial price will force them to meet you halfway, easily netting you $8,000+ per delivery and securing your first massive capital pool within seconds.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 4: The Lemon Depot Decoration Trap Clearance</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Player Need:</strong> Stop your cash flow from completely plateauing when you unlock the third tier.</li>
            <li><strong>The Blueprint Action:</strong> Once you enter the wholesale Lemon Depot district, your progression might suddenly screech to a halt. This is due to the developer's infamous Decoration Gate System.</li>
            <li><strong>The ROI Meta:</strong> Many essential milestone upgrades are hidden until you purchase specific decorations. Buying the Depot Roof alone reveals 3 critical, high-yield progression buttons. If your build menu looks empty, buy the walls, roof, and lights, then walk physically through the warehouse to watch the hidden upgrade buttons spawn!</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>The Golden Idle Strategies</h2>
      <div class="guide-step-flow">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>💤 Strategy A: The Burst-and-Sleep Offline Exploit</h3>
          <p>Unlike generic tycoon games that nerf your earnings by half or cap your progress while you're away, Sell Lemons grants you 100% full offline income indefinitely.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Meta Loop:</strong> Log in, collect 100% of your accumulated offline bank roll, burst-spend all your capital on your highest-yielding automated tiers, and log right back out. Active online play adds no mathematical advantage over offline compounding during mid-game progression!</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>🔄 Strategy B: The 350% Evolve Rule</h3>
          <p>When early scaling begins to drag, you need to use the Evolution (Rebirth) system to gain permanent Alien Investor percentage multipliers.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Meta Loop:</strong> NEVER Evolve under a 200% investor bonus. Rebuilding without a heavy multiplier is a massive waste of time. Wait until your pending bonus hits the community-recognized 350%+ sweet spot. Once you reset at 350%, your powerful multipliers will let you buy back your automated stand loops in less than 60 seconds!</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

